  <data key="d1">"A condition characterized by excessive hyperextension of the knee, often studied in physical therapy and orthopedics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Genu recurvatum syndrome is a condition where the knee hyperextends, leading to instability and potential joint damage."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-704af454e8435279b724980dccc9f577&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56ba6457f7a7f43d803a693f91176eca</data>
