  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Optotrak Motion Analysis System is a tool used to measure joint angles, particularly the range of motion (ROM) of the knee."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-950c58b7df97a4bc1fdeb2087de52f18</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PARALLEL GONIOMETER (PG)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Parallel Goniometer (PG) is a tool used to measure joint angles, particularly the range of motion (ROM) of the knee."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-950c58b7df97a4bc1fdeb2087de52f18</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INTERDEVICE RELIABILITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CATEGORY"</data>
