  <data key="d2">chunk-950c58b7df97a4bc1fdeb2087de52f18</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PEARSON PRODUCT MOMENT CORRELATION COEFFICIENT (R)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CATEGORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Pearson Product Moment Correlation Coefficient (r) is a statistical measure of the linear correlation between two variables."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-950c58b7df97a4bc1fdeb2087de52f18</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;VISUAL ESTIMATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CATEGORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Visual Estimation is a method of estimating joint angles by observation, often used as a less precise alternative to goniometry."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-950c58b7df97a4bc1fdeb2087de52f18</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;GOGIA AND COLLEAGUES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Gogia and colleagues conducted a study on the validity of knee joint angle measurements using a universal goniometer, comparing them with radiographs."&lt;SEP&gt;"Researchers who conducted a study on the reliability and validity of knee joint angle measurements using a universal goniometer."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d86601906259a5a5da4abf14e4637db5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a7abf467a8b1da896b788e651526495</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ELECTRONIC DIGITAL INCLINOMETER (CYBEX EDI320)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An Electronic Digital Inclinometer (CYBEX EDI320) is a device used to measure angles of joint movement, providing precise and repeatable measurements."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0a7abf467a8b1da896b788e651526495</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ELECTROGONIOMETER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An Electrogoniometer is a flexible device used to measure joint angles, particularly useful for assessing range of motion in various body positions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0a7abf467a8b1da896b788e651526495</data>
</node>
