  <data key="d1">"Protopapadaki, A and co-authors published a study in Clin Biomech on the kinematics and kinetics of the hip, knee, and ankle during stair ascent and descent in healthy young individuals."&lt;SEP&gt;"Protopapadaki, A is an author of a study published in Clin Biomech on the kinematics and kinetics of the hip, knee, and ankle during stair ascent and descent in healthy young individuals."</data>
  <data key="d0">"UNKNOWN"</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;POSTERIOR STABILITY&quot;">
