  <data key="d1">"The knee flexors help to provide posterior stability to the knee joint."</data>
  <data key="d0">"UNKNOWN"</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FLEXION-EXTENSION&quot;">
  <data key="d2">chunk-efbffe4c52beae140acaca62d94996bd</data>
  <data key="d1">"Flexion-extension movements of the knee occur in the sagittal plane around the medial-lateral axis."</data>
