  <data key="d3">9.0</data>
  <data key="d4">"Medial knee collapse during squats and lunges can indicate weak glute medius, increasing the risk of ACL injury."</data>
  <data key="d5">"compensation, muscle strength"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7f7944fa53271cc7aa6b58f4001aaa11</data>
</edge>
