  <data key="d3">9.0</data>
  <data key="d4">"Pain during external rotation of the knee can indicate iliotibial band syndrome, a condition where the IT band is inflamed.</data>
  <data key="d5">"pain, joint condition"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7f7944fa53271cc7aa6b58f4001aaa11</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;KNEE&quot;" target="&quot;CAPSULAR PATTERN&quot;">
  <data key="d3">15.0</data>
  <data key="d4">"The capsular pattern of the knee refers to the characteristic limitations in joint movement caused by tightness or stiffness in the joint capsule, often seen in conditions like arthritis."&lt;SEP&gt;"The knee is the joint where a capsular pattern is observed, indicating a specific type of joint restriction."</data>
  <data key="d5">"anatomical structure, joint restriction"&lt;SEP&gt;"joint disorder, medical assessment"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9465146ed06caf8469c30b5a0d8be558&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6854c72d0616470d858bc189ee907e36</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;KNEE&quot;" target="&quot;RANGE OF MOTION TESTING PROCEDURES&quot;">
  <data key="d3">9.0</data>
