  <data key="d3">18.0</data>
  <data key="d4">"Fritz and associates conducted research on the capsular pattern of the knee, finding that patients with a specific ratio of extension loss to flexion loss were more likely to have arthritis or arthroses."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fritz and associates studied patients with a capsular pattern, finding a correlation with a higher likelihood of having arthritis or arthroses of the knee."</data>
  <data key="d5">"research, clinical findings"&lt;SEP&gt;"research, correlation"</data>
